ventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>When TS change information is received from a base station (1), a subscriber station (MS11) changes the time slot of a frame for reception from the base station (1) in accordance with the TS change information.  On the other hand, when TS change information is received from the subscriber station (MS11), the base station (1) changes the time slot of a frame for reception from the subscriber station (MS11) in accordance with the TS change information.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Lorsque des informations de modification d'intervalle de temps sont reçues en provenance d'une station de base (1), un poste (MS11) d'abonné modifie l'intervalle de temps d'une trame pour la réception en provenance de ladite station de base (1) en fonction des informations de modification d'intervalle de temps. Inversement, lorsque des informations de modification d'intervalle de temps sont reçues en provenance du poste (MS11) d'abonné, la station de base (1) modifie l'intervalle de temps d'une trame pour la réception en provenance du poste (MS11) d'abonné en fonction des informations de modification d'intervalle de temps.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>